# No feature branches

This repo is already a personal fork of `ansible/slides`. Do **not** create feature or topic branches.

## Workflow

- Commit and push directly to `main` on `origin` (the fork)
- GitHub Pages for the fork deploys from `main` only — branch pushes will not update the preview site
- Open a PR from fork `main` → `ansible/slides` `main` when ready to contribute upstream
- Sync with `upstream/main` on local `main` before starting new work

## Do not

- `git checkout -b …` for routine edits
- Push changes only to a side branch and expect the fork Pages site to update
